# Hub-specific local artifacts
# *.lic carries operator-issued license keys generated during Phase 02c P6+
# integration tests; never commit one. Production license keys are issued by
# the production Hub and downloaded out-of-band.
*.lic
# *.pem / *.key carry TLS material from Phase 02c P5 (custom-domain DNS-01 /
# HTTP-01 challenges) and from the mTLS chain used by /api/internal/*. Both
# live in Vault in production.
*.pem
*.key
*.crt

# Multi-root workspace files (per-developer; never committed)
*.code-workspace

# Local-only research (gitignored anyway; mirrored from learnstack convention)
docs/analysis/
